  "Can a person actually reach that bolt with a spanner? Can a part only fit one way, so it can't be assembled wrongly? Features like self-locating tabs and slots in sheet metal make assembly faster and more accurate.": "Je, mtu anaweza kufikia boliti hiyo kwa kutumia spana? Je, sehemu inaweza kutoshea upande mmoja tu, kwa hivyo haiwezi kuunganishwa vibaya? Vipengele kama vile vichupo vya kujitambua na nafasi katika karatasi ya chuma hufanya uunganishaji uwe wa haraka na sahihi zaidi.",
