  "Colour palette & fonts": "Paleti ya rangi na fonti",
  "Components, joints and assemblies": "Vipengele, viungo na mikusanyiko",
  "Compute trial stress increments using Hooke's law assuming purely elastic deformation.": "Hesabu nyongeza za msongo wa majaribio kwa kutumia sheria ya Hooke ikizingatia mabadiliko ya elastic pekee.",
  "Contributed to the design and fabrication of a poultry de-feathering machine, from concept to mechanical assembly.": "Imechangia katika usanifu na utengenezaji wa mashine ya kuondoa manyoya ya kuku, kuanzia dhana hadi uundaji wa mitambo.",
  "Conventional von Mises plasticity assumes isotropic yielding, meaning a sheet deforms identically regardless of rolling or build direction. In reality, rolled sheets and additively manufactured metallic layers exhibit strong crystallographic texture and directional mechanical properties characterized by Lankford coefficients (r-values):": "Ubora wa kawaida wa von Mises hudhania kuwa na utofauti wa isotropiki, ikimaanisha kuwa karatasi huharibika sawasawa bila kujali mwelekeo wa kuviringika au ujenzi. Kwa kweli, karatasi zilizoviringishwa na tabaka za metali zilizotengenezwa kwa njia ya nyongeza huonyesha umbile imara la fuwele na sifa za kiufundi za mwelekeo zinazojulikana na viambato vya Lankford (thamani za r):",
  "Coupling Hill'48 with GTN captures both directional thinning and stress-triaxiality-driven fracture—outperforming standard isotropic FLDs on advanced alloys like AlSi10Mg and high-strength steels.": "Coupling Hill'48 na GTN inakamata kupunguka kwa kukonda kwa mwelekeo na kuvunjika kwa msongo wa mawazo—kuzidi FLD za isotropiki za kawaida zinazofanya kazi kwenye aloi za hali ya juu kama vile AlSi10Mg na vyuma vyenye nguvu nyingi.",
  "Coursework: Engineering Design I–III, CAD/CAM, Manufacturing Processes, Strength of Materials, Thermodynamics, Fluid Mechanics, Control Systems, Materials Science.": "Kazi ya Kozi: Ubunifu wa Uhandisi I–III, CAD/CAM, Michakato ya Uzalishaji, Nguvu ya Vifaa, Thermodynamics, Mekaniki za Maji, Mifumo ya Udhibiti, Sayansi ya Vifaa.",
  "Created 3D models, assemblies and 2D technical drawings in SolidWorks, Inventor and Fusion 360 for industrial prototypes.": "Aliunda modeli za 3D, mikusanyiko na michoro ya kiufundi ya 2D katika SolidWorks, Mvumbuzi na Fusion 360 kwa ajili ya mifano ya viwandani.",
  "Creating logos, brand assets, and custom icons": "Kuunda nembo, mali za chapa, na aikoni maalum",
  "Creating multi-page booklets, journals, brochures, and reports": "Kuunda vijitabu, majarida, brosha, na ripoti zenye kurasa nyingi",
  "Creating schedules, material take-offs, and room documentation": "Kuunda ratiba, vifaa vya kupanda, na nyaraka za chumba",
  "Creating social media graphics, posters, and web banners": "Kutengeneza michoro ya mitandao ya kijamii, mabango, na mabango ya wavuti",
  "Custom hole dimensions require specialty drill bits, increasing setup time and tooling expenses:": "Vipimo maalum vya shimo vinahitaji vipande maalum vya kuchimba visima, na hivyo kuongeza muda wa usanidi na gharama za vifaa:",
  "Custom layouts for vision boards, travel plans and a dream-career page": "Miundo maalum ya mbao za maono, mipango ya usafiri na ukurasa wa ndoto-kazi",
  "Cutting through the model is the quickest way to check that the internal parts line up.": "Kukata modeli ndiyo njia ya haraka zaidi ya kuangalia kama sehemu za ndani ziko sawa.",
  "DEMO-2026": "ONYESHO-2026",
  "DFM explained simply: how designing with the workshop in mind cuts cost, avoids rework and gets parts made right the first time.": "DFM ilielezea kwa urahisi: jinsi kubuni kwa kuzingatia warsha hupunguza gharama, kuepuka kufanya kazi upya na kutengeneza vipuri vizuri mara ya kwanza.",
  "DFM in your CAD workflow": "DFM katika mtiririko wako wa kazi wa CAD",
  "Design Parts with a Single Setup in Mind": "Ubunifu wa Vipuri kwa Kuzingatia Usanidi Mmoja",
  "Design for Manufacturability": "Ubunifu wa Uzalishaji",
  "Design, render and make, all in one": "Buni, onyesha na tengeneza, yote kwa pamoja",
  "Designing for Manufacturability:": "Ubunifu wa Uzalishaji:",
  "Designing for Manufacturability: 5 CAD Tips to Reduce Machining Costs": "Ubunifu kwa Ajili ya Uzalishaji: Vidokezo 5 vya CAD vya Kupunguza Gharama za Uchakataji",
  "Designing for manufacturability doesn't mean sacrificing performance or aesthetic appeal. Integrating these practical guidelines early in your CAD workflow ensures your prototypes are not only functionally sound, but also cost-effective and ready for seamless production.": "Kubuni kwa ajili ya utengenezaji haimaanishi kupunguza utendaji au mvuto wa urembo. Kuunganisha miongozo hii ya vitendo mapema katika mtiririko wako wa kazi wa CAD huhakikisha mifano yako si tu kwamba ni mizuri kiutendaji, bali pia ni ya gharama nafuu na iko tayari kwa uzalishaji usio na mshono.",
  "Designs sized for your platforms": "Miundo yenye ukubwa wa majukwaa yako",
  "Determine GTN micro-parameters (": "Tambua vigezo vidogo vya GTN (",
  "Digital Image Correlation (DIC) tracks surface speckle patterns in real time, extracting major and minor principal strains immediately prior to localized necking via position-dependent or time-dependent cross-section methods.": "Uwiano wa Picha Dijitali (DIC) hufuatilia ruwaza za madoadoa ya uso kwa wakati halisi, ikitoa aina kuu na ndogo za msingi mara moja kabla ya kuunganishwa kwa ndani kupitia mbinu za sehemu mtambuka zinazotegemea nafasi au wakati.",
  "Digital version for sharing": "Toleo la kidijitali la kushiriki",
  "Dimensioned 2D drawings (PDF / DWG)": "Michoro ya 2D yenye vipimo (PDF / DWG)",
  "Dimensions, text and annotation styles": "Vipimo, maandishi na mitindo ya maelezo",
  "Discover how combining Nakajima experimental testing with coupled GTN-Hill'48 user material subroutines in Abaqus accurately predicts anisotropic thinning, void-driven ductile fracture, and Forming Limit Curves for advanced sheet alloys like AlSi10Mg.": "Gundua jinsi kuchanganya majaribio ya Nakajima na taratibu ndogo za vifaa vya mtumiaji vya GTN-Hill'48 zilizounganishwa katika Abaqus kunavyotabiri kwa usahihi kukonda kwa anisotropic, kuvunjika kwa ductile inayoendeshwa kwa utupu, na Mikunjo ya Kikomo cha Kuunda kwa aloi za karatasi za hali ya juu kama AlSi10Mg.",
  "Do you include revisions?": "Je, unajumuisha marekebisho?",
  "Do you offer CAD training?": "Je, mnatoa mafunzo ya CAD?",
