  "Engineering & design software installation, licensing setup, and environment configuration": "Usakinishaji wa programu za uhandisi na usanifu, usanidi wa leseni, na usanidi wa mazingira",
  "Engineering design:": "Ubunifu wa uhandisi:",
  "Ensure uniform wall thickness across the part to prevent thermal warping during machining or heat treatment.": "Hakikisha unene wa ukuta unalingana katika sehemu nzima ili kuzuia mgongano wa joto wakati wa usindikaji au matibabu ya joto.",
  "Evaluate the coupled GTN-Hill'48 yield function. If Φ ≤ 0, the step is elastic; update stresses and exit.": "Tathmini kitendakazi cha mavuno cha GTN-Hill'48 kilichounganishwa. Ikiwa Φ ≤ 0, hatua ni ya elastic; sasisha mikazo na utoke.",
  "Every time a machinist has to reposition or flip a stock piece in a vise, labor costs increase:": "Kila wakati fundi fundi anapolazimika kuweka upya au kugeuza kipande cha hisa kwenye vise, gharama za wafanyakazi huongezeka:",
