  "Exporting sheets to PDF and DWG formats": "Kuhamisha laha kwa umbizo la PDF na DWG",
  "Extract major and minor principal strains from elements adjacent to the fracture path at the exact increment prior to element deletion, plotting the complete predicted FLC directly against physical DIC experimental points.": "Toa aina kuu na ndogo kutoka kwa elementi zilizo karibu na njia ya kuvunjika kwa kiwango halisi kabla ya kufutwa kwa elementi, ukichora FLC kamili iliyotabiriwa moja kwa moja dhidi ya sehemu za majaribio za DIC halisi.",
  "FEA or thermal analysis to validate a design before it is built.": "FEA au uchambuzi wa joto ili kuthibitisha muundo kabla haujajengwa.",
  "Fill in the": "Jaza",
  "Final Takeaway": "Mwisho wa Kuchukua",
  "Floors, roofs, ceilings, and stair creation": "Sakafu, paa, dari, na uundaji wa ngazi",
  "For engineering: SolidWorks (including CSWA exam preparation), Autodesk Inventor, AutoCAD, Fusion 360, Revit and Abaqus. For graphics: Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign and Premiere Pro. If you need files in a specific program, just tell me in the project brief.": "Kwa uhandisi: SolidWorks (ikiwa ni pamoja na maandalizi ya mtihani wa CSWA), Mvumbuzi wa Autodesk, AutoCAD, Fusion 360, Revit na Abaqus. Kwa michoro: Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign na Premiere Pro. Ikiwa unahitaji faili katika programu maalum, niambie tu katika muhtasari wa mradi.",
  "For plane-stress sheet forming, F, G, H, and N are calibrated directly from uniaxial tensile tests conducted at 0°, 45°, and 90° relative to the rolling or build orientation.": "Kwa ajili ya uundaji wa karatasi ya mkazo wa plane, F, G, H, na N hupimwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa majaribio ya mvutano ya uniaxial yanayofanywa kwa 0°, 45°, na 90° kuhusiana na mwelekeo wa kuviringisha au kujenga.",
  "Forming Limit Curve": "Mkunjo wa Kikomo cha Kuunda",
  "Frame Generator for structures": "Jenereta ya Fremu kwa ajili ya miundo",
  "Full 3D assembly": "Mkusanyiko kamili wa 3D",
  "Furthermore, ductile metals do not fail instantaneously; they fail through a progressive micromechanical sequence of void nucleation, growth, and coalescence. A purely phenomenological Forming Limit Diagram (FLD) struggles when strain paths become non-linear—which is where coupled damage mechanics becomes indispensable.": "Zaidi ya hayo, metali zenye ductile hazishindwi mara moja; hushindwi kupitia mfuatano unaoendelea wa mikromenika wa nukta tupu, ukuaji, na mshikamano. Mchoro wa Kikomo cha Kuunda Kipengele (FLD) hupambana wakati njia za mkazo zinapokuwa zisizo za mstari—ambapo ndipo mitambo ya uharibifu iliyounganishwa inakuwa muhimu sana.",
  "Fusion 360": "Muunganisho 360",
  "GTN Model": "Mfano wa GTN",
  "Generating elevations, sections, and 3D architectural views": "Kuzalisha mwinuko, sehemu, na mandhari ya usanifu wa 3D",
  "Graphic design:": "Ubunifu wa picha:",
