  "If a deep pocket is necessary, consider breaking the design into a modular two-piece assembly.": "Ikiwa mfuko mrefu unahitajika, fikiria kuugawanya muundo huo katika mfumo wa vipande viwili vya moduli.",
  "If multi-axis machining is required, ensure the part has flat, parallel reference surfaces for secure clamping.": "Ikiwa usindikaji wa mhimili mingi unahitajika, hakikisha sehemu hiyo ina nyuso tambarare na sambamba za marejeleo kwa ajili ya kubana kwa usalama.",
  "If Φ is greater than 0, solve the non-linear system of equations iteratively via the Newton-Raphson method to enforce plastic consistency while updating the plastic multiplier (": "Ikiwa Φ ni kubwa kuliko 0, suluhisha mfumo usio wa mstari wa milinganyo mara kwa mara kupitia mbinu ya Newton-Raphson ili kutekeleza uthabiti wa plastiki huku ukisasisha kizidishi cha plastiki (",
  "Illustrator": "Mchoraji",
  "Image editing, photo retouching, graphic design, and digital compositing": "Uhariri wa picha, urekebishaji wa picha, usanifu wa picha, na utunzi wa kidijitali",
  "In modern manufacturing—particularly across automotive lightweighting, aerospace structural panels, and additive manufacturing post-processing—pushing sheet alloys to their geometric limits without triggering localized necking or ductile fracture is a primary engineering challenge. Traditional forming simulations often rely on phenomenological criteria that break down when dealing with complex multi-axial strain paths or anisotropic microstructures such as additively manufactured AlSi10Mg.": "Katika utengenezaji wa kisasa—hasa katika uzani wa magari, paneli za miundo ya anga za juu, na utengenezaji wa nyongeza baada ya usindikaji—kusukuma aloi za karatasi hadi mipaka yake ya kijiometri bila kusababisha shingo ya ndani au kuvunjika kwa ductile ni changamoto kuu ya uhandisi. Uigaji wa kitamaduni mara nyingi hutegemea vigezo vya fenomenolojia ambavyo huvunjika wakati wa kushughulika na njia tata za mvutano wa axial nyingi au miundo midogo ya anisotropiki kama vile AlSi10Mg iliyotengenezwa kwa nyongeza.",
  "Indesign": "Ubunifu wa ndani",
  "Interface, command aliases and drafting settings": "Kiolesura, majina bandia ya amri na mipangilio ya uandishi",
  "Intro to simulation (FEA) studies": "Masomo ya utangulizi wa simulizi (FEA)",
