  "Introduction to simulation": "Utangulizi wa simulizi",
  "It depends on the scope. A single poster is much quicker than a full assembly with simulation. We agree on a timeline together when I send your quote, and I'll keep you updated along the way.": "Inategemea wigo. Bango moja ni la haraka zaidi kuliko mkusanyiko kamili wenye simulizi. Tunakubaliana kuhusu ratiba pamoja nitakapotuma nukuu yako, nami nitakujulisha kila wakati.",
