  "Multi-layer PTFE/grease tribological stacks minimize punch-sheet friction so fracture initiates near the dome apex rather than at the clamp radius.": "Mirundiko ya tribolojia ya PTFE/grisi yenye tabaka nyingi hupunguza msuguano wa karatasi ya kuchomwa kwa hivyo fracture huanza karibu na kilele cha kuba badala ya kwenye radius ya clamp.",
