  "The command aliases, function keys and object snaps I teach in every AutoCAD class, on one printable page.": "Majina bandia ya amri, vitufe vya chaguo-msingi na vijipicha vya vitu ninavyofundisha katika kila darasa la AutoCAD, kwenye ukurasa mmoja unaoweza kuchapishwa.",
  "Thin walls vibrate under high cutting forces, leading to poor surface finishes and dimensional inaccuracy:": "Kuta nyembamba hutetemeka chini ya nguvu kubwa za kukata, na kusababisha umaliziaji duni wa uso na ukosefu wa usahihi wa vipimo:",
  "Thread holes only as deep as necessary—typically 2 to 3 times the fastener diameter provides maximum holding strength.": "Mashimo ya uzi yenye kina kirefu tu inavyohitajika—kwa kawaida mara 2 hadi 3 ya kipenyo cha kitasa hutoa nguvu ya juu zaidi ya kushikilia.",
  "Three sections: About Me, Dreams & Visions, and The Woman Called Mackrine": "Sehemu tatu: Kuhusu Mimi, Ndoto na Maono, na Mwanamke Anayeitwa Mackrine",
  "To accurately capture failure onset before cutting expensive stamping dies, finite element analysts couple anisotropic yield surfaces with micromechanical damage models. Here is a technical breakdown of how combining Nakajima experimental testing with a coupled GTN-Hill'48 user material subroutine (VUMAT/UMAT) in Abaqus delivers high-fidelity Forming Limit Curves (FLCs).": "Ili kunasa kwa usahihi mwanzo wa hitilafu kabla ya kukata stendi za gharama kubwa za kukanyaga, wachambuzi wa vipengele vya mwisho huunganisha nyuso za mavuno ya anisotropiki na mifumo ya uharibifu wa mikromeniki. Hapa kuna uchanganuzi wa kiufundi wa jinsi kuchanganya majaribio ya Nakajima na utaratibu mdogo wa nyenzo za mtumiaji wa GTN-Hill'48 (VUMAT/UMAT) katika Abaqus kunavyotoa Mikunjo ya Kikomo cha Kuunda (FLCs) yenye uaminifu wa hali ya juu.",
  "To construct the simulated FLC across all Nakajima specimen widths:": "Ili kujenga FLC iliyoigwa katika upana wote wa sampuli ya Nakajima:",
  "To replicate the Nakajima test numerically in Abaqus/Explicit or Abaqus/Standard, two constitutive pillars are merged into a single custom subroutine:": "Ili kunakili jaribio la Nakajima kwa nambari katika Abaqus/Explicit au Abaqus/Standard, nguzo mbili za muundo huunganishwa katika utaratibu mmoja maalum:",
  "Toolbars, workspace customization, and performance tuning": "Upau wa vidhibiti, ubinafsishaji wa nafasi ya kazi, na uboreshaji wa utendaji",
