  "Troubleshooting software crashes, missing DLLs, and startup errors": "Kutatua matatizo ya programu kushindwa kufanya kazi, DLL zinazokosekana, na hitilafu za kuanzisha programu",
  "Try to keep all critical features (holes, slots, pockets) aligned along a single primary axis.": "Jaribu kuweka vipengele vyote muhimu (mashimo, nafasi, mifuko) vikiwa vimepangwa kwenye mhimili mmoja mkuu.",
  "Two kinds of work through Nexus CAD Studio.": "Aina mbili za kazi kupitia Nexus CAD Studio.",
  "Typography, character styling, and text effects": "Uchapaji, mtindo wa wahusika, na athari za maandishi",
  "Typography, paragraph styles, character styles, and hierarchy": "Uchapaji, mitindo ya aya, mitindo ya wahusika, na uongozi",
  "Use consistent shell or continuum shell element sizes (typically 0.5 mm to 1.0 mm in the dome gauge zone) because damage softening introduces intrinsic mesh dependency.": "Tumia ukubwa thabiti wa vipengele vya ganda au ganda endelevu (kawaida 0.5 mm hadi 1.0 mm katika eneo la kipimo cha kuba) kwa sababu ulainishaji wa uharibifu huanzisha utegemezi wa ndani wa matundu.",
  "Use standard tap drill sizes (e.g., M3, M4, M6, or M8) available in standard tool carousels.": "Tumia ukubwa wa kawaida wa kuchimba visima vya bomba (k.m., M3, M4, M6, au M8) unaopatikana katika vifuniko vya kawaida vya zana.",
