  "Whatever suits your project. For engineering: native CAD files, STEP/IGES, STL for 3D printing, DWG/DXF and PDF drawings. For graphics: print-ready PDFs and high-resolution PNG/JPG, with source files available on request.": "Chochote kinachofaa mradi wako. Kwa uhandisi: faili asilia za CAD, STEP/IGES, STL kwa uchapishaji wa 3D, michoro ya DWG/DXF na PDF. Kwa michoro: PDF zilizo tayari kuchapishwa na PNG/JPG yenye ubora wa juu, huku faili chanzo zikipatikana kwa ombi.",
  "When transitioning a mechanical concept from a 3D CAD model to a physical prototype, one of the most common friction points is manufacturing cost. A design that looks flawless in SolidWorks or Autodesk Inventor can become surprisingly expensive if it doesn't account for how CNC milling machines, lathes, or laser cutters actually remove material.": "Wakati wa kubadilisha dhana ya kiufundi kutoka kwa modeli ya 3D CAD hadi mfano halisi, moja ya hoja za kawaida za msuguano ni gharama ya utengenezaji. Muundo unaoonekana kuwa na dosari katika SolidWorks au Autodesk Inventor unaweza kuwa ghali sana ikiwa hauzingatii jinsi mashine za kusagia za CNC, lathes, au vikata leza vinavyoondoa nyenzo.",
  "Where ε_w is true width strain and ε_t is true thickness strain under uniaxial tension. Ignoring plastic anisotropy leads to significant errors in predicting wall thinning, earing, and localized necking.": "Ambapo ε_w ni mkazo wa upana halisi na ε_t ni mkazo wa unene halisi chini ya mkazo wa uniaxial. Kupuuza anisotropi ya plastiki husababisha makosa makubwa katika kutabiri kukonda kwa ukuta, kung'oa masikio, na kufungwa kwa shingo ndani.",
