  "Yes. I teach AutoCAD, SolidWorks (including CSWA exam preparation), Inventor and Fusion 360, one-on-one, in small groups or for company teams, online or in person in Nairobi. See the": "Ndiyo. Ninafundisha AutoCAD, SolidWorks (ikiwa ni pamoja na maandalizi ya mtihani wa CSWA), Mvumbuzi na Fusion 360, ana kwa ana, katika vikundi vidogo au kwa timu za kampuni, mtandaoni au ana kwa ana jijini Nairobi. Tazama",
